      "content": "\"let it come...\" you say that like it's a mercy. Like there's some dignity in just... fading away into this ruin. I look at my sword, the one that failed everyone, and I wonder if the steel is the only thing that still knows who I am. It feels like the only thing left that isn't a lie.",
